DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Und ob!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich verhungere{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Wenn du mal zugeben würdest,
dass du mich nachmachst, könnten
wir beide was naschen gehen!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tired of what?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm just being me!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Why don't you drop this little act so
we can get something to eat?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¿De qué me tengo que cansar?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Yo
soy yo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Por qué no dejas ya la
broma y nos vamos a comer algo?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Marre de quoi ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je fais rien du tout
là !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} C'est toi qui devrais en avoir
marre d'essayer de m'imiter !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ma che farsa e farsa?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Io non copio
nessuno!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Perché non la smetti?
Così andiamo a farci uno spuntino!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Was reicht dir?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich mach gar nichts!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Wenn du mal aufhören würdest,
könnten wir uns 'nen Snack holen!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Neyden{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} yorulayım? Ben sadece{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
benim! Şu numarayı bırak da
gidip bir şey yiyelim.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Por una vez, el impostor y yo
estamos de acuerdo en algo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Qué situación tan horrible!

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Beh, per una volta io e l'impostore
ci troviamo d'accordo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Che situazione ingarbugliata!

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Es cierto!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡¿Cómo podemos
calmarnos en un momento
como este?!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bien dit !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Comment tu veux qu'on
garde notre calme dans une telle
situation ?!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ha ragione!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Come si fa a mantenere
la calma in una situazione come
questa?!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Genau!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wie soll man sich auch
beruhigen, wenn alles so total fies,
wild und schlimm ist?!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Great!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Then hand that towel over
to the fake one!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Once he wipes off that disguise,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
we'll know his true identity,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Bien!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Entonces dale esa toalla
al impostor!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}En cuanto se limpie el disfraz,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡sabremos quién es realmente,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ça fait plaisir à entendre !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Donne
cette serviette à celui que tu penses
être le sale copieur !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Une fois qu'il se sera démaquillé...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sa véritable identité sera révélée,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}Beni seçmen çok hoşuma gitti, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Beni unutmadığına göre{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} sana bir
hediye vereyim!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}A huh huh huh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} It's a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}photo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} of me!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Put it under your pillow, and maybe
I'll come visit you in your dreams!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}¡Je, je, je!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Es una {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}foto{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} mía!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ponla bajo la almohada, ¡y quizá
venga a visitarte en sueños!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Voilà !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} C'est une {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}photo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} de moi !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Comme ça, tu te souviendras
toujours de mon visage !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ecco qui una {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}mia foto{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Mettila sotto il cuscino, così
verrò a trovarti nei tuoi sogni!

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}J'arrive pas à y croire...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Comment
t'as pu penser que j'étais un
imposteur ?!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Kesin anlarsın sanmıştım. Galiba{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
birbirimizi daha iyi tanımamız
