{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Kesin{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} doğru seçersin sanmıştım.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
